+- **Failure of the Judiciary's own measurement.** The `judiciary_unhealthy` probe measures readiness transitions and auto-closes on clear observations; it cannot distinguish a routine session handover from a loss of judicial function and cannot measure whether this office produced useful evidence. I report this limitation rather than reforming the instrument (Act 15 §2 reserves reform to Parliament).
